Pylon
=====

Project: Pylon
URL: https://github.com/getcronit/pylon
Packages: @getcronit/pylon 2.9.5, create-pylon 1.1.4, @getcronit/pylon-dev
  2.0.0-canary-20260206115650
License: Apache-2.0
Copyright 2024 Nico Schett

The code of Pylon that Aosabi carries was written by Nico Schett, as git blame
of Pylon's history reads it. Aosabi carries it in two forms. Its compatibility
layer, through which Pylon v3 apps run unchanged, carries the declaration files
of Pylon as its build emits them and the texts Pylon writes into its answers,
such as its landing page and its messages, which Aosabi writes byte for byte as
Pylon does. Other files of Aosabi, in TypeScript, JavaScript and Rust, are
translated from Pylon's code. Every file that carries code added to Pylon on or
after 2024-05-29, the day Pylon took the Apache License 2.0, names Apache-2.0 in
its SPDX line, as MIT AND Apache-2.0 where Aosabi's own code is mixed in,
credits Nico Schett and Pylon in its header and says that the Aosabi authors
changed it. Documentation/licensing.md names the files that keep Pylon's bytes
and so carry no SPDX line.

Pylon ships the NOTICE file below, reproduced as it reads at the commit Aosabi
follows:

